            "review_title": "Review at Phuc Mieu Dimsum & Tea House",
            "review_text": "Nina1072\nNha Trang, Vietnam88 contributions\n0\nNothing to do with the pics!\nApr 2019 • Family\nWe had delivery and every dishes we ordered had nothing to do with the pics. We took a roasted pork and a roasted chicken, on the pics it was a piece of pork and a chicken leg, we got small minced bits of those with fried rice and noodles, missed surimi in the surimi and shrimp dish... Nothing was good anyway except the chicken with oyster sauce but once again there was just a few bits of minced chicken.\nIt's cheap but the portions are too small\nRead more\nValue\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 12, 2019\nNhật hoàng\nplease give me some information from somewwhere u got the order because may be it's wrong place that u was order because we don't have roasted pork and roasted chicken for a long time, we have only fried rice with roasted pork or chicken... i'm sorry if it's make u uncomfortable in yourvacation .\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
